WEBVTT

00:20.259 --> 00:22.535
Hello, student drivers.
各位司机同学大家好。

00:22.535 --> 00:24.604
I'm Mrs. Penelope Puff,
我是佩内洛普·普夫夫人

00:24.604 --> 00:27.466
and as per the court order,
根据法院命令，

00:27.466 --> 00:29.569
I will be
your driving instructor
我会的
你的驾驶教练

00:29.569 --> 00:31.811
in this education film.
在这部教育片中。

00:31.811 --> 00:36.638
By remembering these
138 simple rules of the road,
通过记住这些
138条简单的交通规则，

00:36.638 --> 00:39.328
every one of you will know
all that you need
你们每个人都会知道
所有你需要的

00:39.328 --> 00:42.983
to get
your very own boating license.
得到
您自己的划船执照。

00:42.983 --> 00:45.087
Even me?
连我也这样吗？

00:46.673 --> 00:47.949
First lesson...
第一课...

00:51.225 --> 00:53.638
<i>Here we have Mr. Good Driver.</i>
<i>好司机先生来了。</i>

00:53.638 --> 00:55.604
<i>Before starting the vehicle,</i>
<i>启动车辆之前，</i>

00:55.604 --> 00:59.569
<i>he always inspects five areas
of his boat for safety.</i>
<i>他总是检查五个区域
为了安全起见，他的船。</i>

00:59.569 --> 01:01.845
<i>He checks his tire buoyancy...</i>
<i>他检查了轮胎的浮力......</i>

01:03.294 --> 01:05.535
<i>Ensures his propeller</i>
<i>确保他的螺旋桨</i>

01:05.535 --> 01:07.431
<i>is properly oiled...</i>
<i>已正确上油...</i>

01:09.707 --> 01:12.294
<i>Confirms his boat horn
is functioning...</i>
<i>确认他的船喇叭
正在运行...</i>

01:12.294 --> 01:15.811
<i>Reviews his signals...</i>
<i>检查他的信号...</i>

01:18.225 --> 01:20.225
<i>And most importantly,</i>
<i>最重要的是，</i>

01:20.225 --> 01:23.604
<i>he fastens his seat belt...</i>
<i>他系好安全带...</i>

01:23.604 --> 01:26.638
And here we have a bad driver,
我们这里有一个糟糕的司机，

01:26.638 --> 01:29.225
<i>or what I refer to as</i>
<i>或者我所说的</i>

01:29.225 --> 01:30.880
<i>a "SpongeBob."</i>
<i>“海绵宝宝”。</i>

01:30.880 --> 01:32.535
Check tire pressure.
检查轮胎气压。

01:35.983 --> 01:37.673
Oil propeller, check.
油螺旋桨，检查。

01:43.225 --> 01:45.259
Check horn, check.
检查喇叭，检查。

01:46.431 --> 01:49.604
Out of the way!
让开！

01:49.604 --> 01:53.259
Check signals, checkerino!
检查信号，checkerino！

01:53.259 --> 01:54.535
Seat belt...
安全带...

01:56.914 --> 01:58.569
Belted!
系腰带！

01:58.569 --> 02:00.569
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:00.569 --> 02:03.121
Can I get my license now?
我现在可以拿到驾照吗？

02:03.121 --> 02:04.535
<i>No.</i>
<i>没有。</i>

02:04.535 --> 02:06.776
Now to our second lesson...
现在我们的第二课...

02:09.466 --> 02:11.604
<i>As he begins his journey,</i>
<i>当他开始他的旅程时，</i>

02:11.604 --> 02:13.466
<i>Mr. Good Driver makes sure</i>
<i>先生。好的司机确保</i>

02:13.466 --> 02:16.156
<i>to watch carefully
for oncoming boats.</i>
<i>仔细观察
迎面而来的船只。</i>

02:16.156 --> 02:17.949
<i>Only when the road is clear</i>
<i>只有当道路畅通时</i>

02:17.949 --> 02:20.638
<i>does he accelerate
into traffic.</i>
<i>他加速吗
进入交通。</i>

02:22.500 --> 02:23.811
Beep, beep.
嘟嘟嘟。

02:27.500 --> 02:29.362
Can I get my license now?
我现在可以拿到驾照吗？

02:29.362 --> 02:30.811
<i>No!</i>
<i>不！</i>

02:30.811 --> 02:32.569
Lesson three...
第三课...

02:34.569 --> 02:36.569
<i>There are several types
of pedestrians.</i>
<i>有几种类型
行人。</i>

02:36.569 --> 02:38.190
<i>So Mr. Good Driver</i>
<i>好司机先生</i>

02:38.190 --> 02:41.087
<i>always keeps careful watch.</i>
<i>始终保持仔细观察。</i>

02:41.087 --> 02:44.328
<i>Here we have the cunning
little, old lady.</i>
<i>我们有狡猾的
小老太太。</i>

02:48.259 --> 02:51.121
Aw, and the babbling baby
噢，还有那个喋喋不休的婴儿

02:51.121 --> 02:53.087
<i>in a buggy.</i>
<i>在一辆马车里。</i>

02:54.811 --> 02:57.052
Whoa!
哇！

02:57.052 --> 02:59.397
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇、哇、哇、哇！

02:59.397 --> 03:00.880
<i>The common fruit vendor...</i>
<i>普通的水果摊贩...</i>

03:05.431 --> 03:07.949
<i>And naturally,
we see some workmen</i>
<i>自然地，
我们看到一些工人</i>

03:07.949 --> 03:10.845
<i>carrying a large pane of glass.</i>
<i>携带一块大玻璃。</i>

03:10.845 --> 03:12.811
How cliché!
多么陈词滥调啊！

03:17.362 --> 03:20.225
both: Whoa...
两人：哇……

03:21.431 --> 03:23.294
<i>Mr. Good Driver may think</i>
<i>先生。好司机可能会想</i>

03:23.294 --> 03:24.880
<i>he can let his guard down,</i>
<i>他可以放松警惕，</i>

03:24.880 --> 03:27.190
<i>but there's
still one pedestrian</i>
<i>但是有
还有一个行人</i>

03:27.190 --> 03:28.949
<i>waiting to strike.</i>
<i>等待罢工。</i>

03:30.811 --> 03:33.811
<i>The rare
Poriferous Aggravatus,</i>
<i>稀有的
多孔Aggravatus，</i>

03:33.811 --> 03:37.914
<i>commonly known as a SpongeBob.</i>
<i>通常被称为海绵宝宝。</i>

03:37.914 --> 03:39.018
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

03:40.811 --> 03:45.259
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

03:55.259 --> 03:56.742
Whoa!
哇！

03:58.983 --> 04:01.569
Hey,
can I get my license now?
嘿，
我现在可以拿到驾照吗？

04:03.190 --> 04:04.949
<i>Lesson 29...</i>
<i>第 29 课...</i>

04:08.742 --> 04:12.362
<i>Mr. Good Driver must obey
various road signs.</i>
<i>先生。好司机必须遵守
各种路标。</i>

04:12.362 --> 04:15.121
<i>Here are just a few...</i>
<i>这里只是一些......</i>

04:15.121 --> 04:17.259
<i>Speed bumps...</i>
<i>减速带...</i>

04:17.259 --> 04:18.397
Ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢！

04:18.397 --> 04:21.569
Ow, ow, ow--
呜呜呜——

04:21.569 --> 04:23.397
<i>Slow children at play...</i>
<i>缓慢的孩子们在玩耍......</i>

04:39.983 --> 04:42.190
<i>Sometimes,
even Mr. Good Driver</i>
有时，
甚至是好司机先生</i>

04:42.190 --> 04:44.880
<i>may be overwhelmed
with directions.</i>
<i>可能会不知所措
有指示。</i>

04:48.811 --> 04:51.431
<i>Never read a road map
while driving.</i>
<i>从不阅读路线图
开车时。</i>

04:51.431 --> 04:54.466
<i>That's something only
a SpongeBob would do.</i>
<i>仅此而已
海绵宝宝就可以了。</i>

04:55.845 --> 04:57.018
Huh?
啊？

04:57.018 --> 04:59.983
Hey, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

05:11.673 --> 05:13.673
Lesson 53...
第 53 课...

05:16.259 --> 05:17.673
<i>Good driving also means</i>
<i>良好的驾驶能力也意味着</i>

05:17.673 --> 05:19.949
<i>being a good passenger--</i>
<i>做一名好乘客--</i>

05:19.949 --> 05:22.294
<i>never distract your driver.</i>
<i>永远不要分散司机的注意力。</i>

05:22.294 --> 05:24.880
Guess what, Squidward.
I'm gonna get my license today.
你猜怎么着，章鱼哥。
今天我就要拿到驾照了

05:24.880 --> 05:28.087
Mrs. Puff said, at the end
of the film, I'm gonna get it.
普芙女士最后说
电影的内容，我会得到它。

05:30.190 --> 05:33.500
Oh, you're gonna get it
all right.
哦，你会得到它
好吧。

05:33.500 --> 05:36.845
<i>It's also important
not to be a backseat driver.</i>
<i>这也很重要
不要成为后座司机。</i>

05:36.845 --> 05:40.225
Ooh, I can drive
from the back seat?
哦，我会开车
从后座？

05:42.673 --> 05:44.087
Stop it!
停下来！

05:44.087 --> 05:46.362
You're driving me crazy!
你快把我逼疯了！

05:46.362 --> 05:47.638
Whoa!
哇！

05:49.811 --> 05:51.914
<i>Finally, as a passenger,</i>
<i>最后，作为乘客，</i>

05:51.914 --> 05:53.569
<i>you must never play</i>
<i>你绝对不能玩</i>

05:53.569 --> 05:55.604
<i>with the boat's
control console.</i>
<i>与船的
控制台。</i>

05:55.604 --> 05:57.362
Let's get some tunes
going here.
让我们来听几首曲子吧
去这里。

06:02.294 --> 06:04.121
How 'bout some AC?
来点空调怎么样？

06:06.638 --> 06:08.914
Brr, too cold.
呃，太冷了。

06:11.466 --> 06:14.018
Ooh, let me help you with that.
哦，让我帮你吧。

06:21.845 --> 06:26.294
all: [slow-motion] Oh, no.
所有人：[慢动作]哦，不。

06:29.397 --> 06:33.466
all: [slow-motion] No...
全体：[慢动作]不……

06:36.880 --> 06:38.328
<i>Lesson 54...</i>
<i>第 54 课...</i>

06:40.294 --> 06:42.569
<i>Even Mr. Good Driver
may be tempted</i>
<i>甚至是好司机先生
可能会受到诱惑</i>

06:42.569 --> 06:43.949
<i>to take out his anger</i>
<i>发泄他的愤怒</i>

06:43.949 --> 06:45.500
<i>on a fellow motorist.</i>
<i>在一位驾车者身上。</i>

06:57.707 --> 06:59.466
<i>In times like these,</i>
<i>在这样的时代，</i>

06:59.466 --> 07:01.294
<i>remember one simple word--</i>
<i>记住一个简单的词——</i>

07:07.328 --> 07:08.845
Oh, I know this one.
哦，我知道这个。

07:11.121 --> 07:12.845
Let me help you relax, friend.
让我帮你放松吧，朋友。

07:12.845 --> 07:15.294
Just breathe in.
只要吸气。

07:17.052 --> 07:18.087
And out.
然后出去。

07:19.811 --> 07:22.362
That's it.
Now, how about a relaxing
就是这样。
现在，放松一下怎么样？

07:22.362 --> 07:23.742
cup of kelp tea?
一杯海带茶？

07:33.466 --> 07:35.087
Refreshing, right?
令人耳目一新，对吧？

07:35.087 --> 07:37.294
- Mm-hmm.
- Now, let's rake some sand.
- 嗯嗯。
- 现在，让我们耙一些沙子。

07:42.535 --> 07:44.466
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

07:44.466 --> 07:46.949
There, relaxed.
在那里，放松。

07:54.190 --> 07:56.087
Maybe it's time
to go elsewhere.
也许是时候了
去其他地方。

08:09.569 --> 08:12.087
Eee...
哎呀……

08:18.052 --> 08:19.949
This darn projector--
这该死的投影仪——

08:19.949 --> 08:22.983
just when we were
getting to the good part.
就当我们
到达好的部分。

08:22.983 --> 08:24.328
Don't worry, Mrs. Puff.
别担心，帕夫夫人。

08:24.328 --> 08:26.742
Let a good noodle
handle that for you.
放一碗好面
为你处理。

08:26.742 --> 08:28.604
No, SpongeBob, that's okay.
不，海绵宝宝，没关系。

08:28.604 --> 08:30.880
Whoa!
哇！

08:30.880 --> 08:33.397
Huh?
啊？

08:33.397 --> 08:35.983
I'm ready for my close-up.
我已经准备好特写了。

08:37.811 --> 08:39.397
Get out of there!
离开那里！

08:39.397 --> 08:41.845
Yes, ma'am.
是的，女士。

08:41.845 --> 08:44.673
Well, I guess we can't finish
好吧，我想我们无法完成

08:44.673 --> 08:47.673
the film.
电影。

08:47.673 --> 08:49.328
B--b--but
if we can't finish the film,
B--b--但是
如果我们不能完成这部电影

08:49.328 --> 08:52.397
we can't finish class!
我们无法下课！

08:52.397 --> 08:53.880
And if we can't finish class,
如果我们不能完成课程

08:53.880 --> 08:56.259
then I can't get my license.
那我就拿不到执照了。

08:57.569 --> 08:58.535
I know.
我知道。

08:58.535 --> 09:00.156
I'll finish the film myself.
我会亲自完成这部电影。

09:03.500 --> 09:06.914
And now, the moment
you've all been waiting for.
而现在，此刻
你们都一直在等待。

09:09.949 --> 09:12.707
SpongeBob's boating license.
海绵宝宝的划船执照。

09:12.707 --> 09:15.431
SpongeBob was
such an exemplary driver...
海绵宝宝是
这样的模范司机...

09:15.431 --> 09:17.156
Oh, puh-lease.
哦，租借。

09:17.156 --> 09:19.880
That a special ceremony
was held in his honor
那一场特殊的仪式
为纪念他而举行

09:19.880 --> 09:23.087
at city hall.
It was a dream come true.
在市政厅。
这是梦想成真。

09:23.087 --> 09:26.362
Mrs. Puff had deemed him
worthy of the road.
普夫夫人认为他
值得上路。

09:26.362 --> 09:29.742
He finally had
a dazzling, genuine,
他终于拥有了
令人眼花缭乱、真实、

09:29.742 --> 09:32.880
full-sized boating license!
全尺寸划船许可证！

09:32.880 --> 09:35.949
Now, imbued with the power
of good driving,
现在，充满了力量
良好的驾驶能力，

09:35.949 --> 09:37.294
SpongeBob brought peace
海绵宝宝带来了和平

09:37.294 --> 09:39.466
to the people
of this troubled world.
给人民
这个多灾多难的世界。

09:39.466 --> 09:41.880
He delivered Krabby Patties
to the hungry.
他送了蟹肉饼
给饥饿的人。

09:44.983 --> 09:47.294
He de-escalated petty crime.
他减少了轻微犯罪。

09:49.294 --> 09:51.535
Yay!
耶！

09:51.535 --> 09:54.431
And he even kept the ice cap
from melting.
他甚至保留了冰帽
从融化。

09:54.431 --> 09:56.466
Yes, everyone loved SpongeBob
是的，每个人都喜欢海绵宝宝

09:56.466 --> 09:59.052
more than ever now that
he had his boating license.
more than ever now that
他有划船执照。

09:59.052 --> 10:01.707
They all loved him so much.
他们都非常爱他。

10:04.742 --> 10:07.294
That is quite enough!
这已经足够了！

10:11.259 --> 10:13.811
We'll resume the correct lesson
next week.
我们将继续正确的课程
下周。

10:13.811 --> 10:16.225
Class is dismissed.
下课了。

10:16.225 --> 10:18.638
Just remember
what you learned today,
只要记住
你今天学到了什么，

10:18.638 --> 10:21.535
and no more of this nonsense!
别再说这些废话了！

10:25.707 --> 10:28.121
all: Yes, Mrs. Puff.
全体：是的，帕芙女士。

10:34.949 --> 10:37.225
Whoa!
Wee!
哇！
威！

10:41.190 --> 10:43.466
Beep, beep!
嘟嘟嘟！

嘟嘟嘟！